  "title": "Aey raat zaraa aahista guzar",
  "body": "Aey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nAshoor ki shab Zainab ney kahaa,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\nEhsaan tera mujh par hogaa,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nLutjaaeingay kal khaimey saarey,\nJal jaayegi masnad Ahmed ki\n<<DIVIDER>>\nHojaayega kal khaali jhoola,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nSuljhaaney baetthi hai Laila\nAkber ki bikhri zulfoun ko\nMaloom nahin kal kya hogaa,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nKal pyaasey baraati aayeingay\nKal Qasim ki shaadi hoveygi\nHojaayegi kal Kubra beywaa,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nAbbas-e-Alambardaar bhi\nTalwaar pa saiqal kartay hain\nKal inko hai johar dikhlaana,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nEk baar apney bharay ghar ko\nJee bharkay dekh toh ley Zainab\nKal hojaayega sannaata,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nJee bhar kay dekh toh ley aye Zainab\nAaj apney bhaayi ki soorath\nKatt jaayega kal Sarwar ka gala\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar\n<<DIVIDER>>\nKis yaas sey aur kis hasrat sey\nZainab yeh bayaan karti thi Sayeed\nAahista guzar aey raat zaraa,\nAey raat zaraa aahista guzar",
